{#
Generated by: Claude Code CLI
Date time: 2026/09/11 14:05 SAST
Version: 0.7
Description:
  Who the reader is, shown under the page head on every page of the platform.

  It began as markup inside Personal Particulars, became the Account pages' header, and is now the
  whole platform's: the band reads the same whether somebody is looking at their own profile or at
  the course catalogue. Owner's instruction, 2026/09/11.

  Included by page-head.html.twig rather than by each page, so a page cannot forget it and cannot
  put it anywhere but directly under the head.

  A signed-out reader gets the same band - the same height, the same shape - with a placeholder mark
  and a way in. A header that appears for some readers and not others makes the page jump about
  depending on who is looking at it.

  Every value is guarded. strict_variables makes an undefined variable an error for the whole page,
  and this renders on pages whose own data has nothing to do with an identity.

  Comments here are plain prose only: no comment delimiters and no code, not even to document one.
Changelog:
  2026/09/11 14:05 SAST
  - Rolled out platform-wide and given the signed-out state.
  2026/09/11 09:20 SAST
  - Created so every Account page opens with the identity, not only Personal Particulars.
#}
{% set identity_signed_in = is_authenticated is defined and is_authenticated %}
<section class="cl-identity-head">
	<div class="container-fluid cl-container-wide cl-identity-head-inner">
		{% if identity_signed_in %}
			{% if identity_image is defined and identity_image %}
				<img class="cl-profile-avatar" src="{{ identity_image }}" alt="" width="72" height="72">
			{% else %}
				<div class="avatar cl-profile-avatar-empty">
					{{ identity_name is defined and identity_name ? identity_name|slice(0, 1)|upper : '?' }}
				</div>
			{% endif %}
			<div class="profile-meta cl-identity-head-meta">
				<h2>
					{{ identity_name is defined ? identity_name : '' }}
				</h2>
				<p>
					{{ identity_email is defined ? identity_email : '' }}
				</p>
				<div class="chip-row cl-mt-2">
					{% if identity_roles is defined %}
						{% for role in identity_roles %}
							<span class="badge info">{{ role }}</span>
						{% endfor %}
					{% endif %}
					{% if identity_status is defined and identity_status %}
						<span class="badge good">{{ identity_status }}</span>
					{% endif %}
				</div>
			</div>
		{% else %}
			<div class="avatar cl-profile-avatar-empty cl-identity-head-anonymous" aria-hidden="true">
				<svg width="34" height="34" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="{{ platform.icon_sprite }}#nav-account"></use></svg>
			</div>
			<div class="profile-meta cl-identity-head-meta">
				<h2>
					Welcome to {{ app.name }}
				</h2>
				<p>
					Sign in to see your courses, or register to start one.
				</p>
				<div class="chip-row cl-mt-2">
					<a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/login">Sign in</a>
					<a class="btn btn-soft btn-sm" href="/login">Register</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		{% endif %}
	</div>
</section>
